      "answer": "$+\\infty$",
      "claim": "SUB((x-1)/(x-2)^2, 2.001) > 100000 ;; SUB((x-1)/(x-2)^2, 1.999) > 100000 ;; LIM((x-2)^2/(x-1), 2) == 0"
    },
    {
      "title": "找漸近線，排除洞",
      "prompt": "$r(x) = \\frac{x^2 - 1}{x^2 - 3x + 2}$ 的垂直漸近線",
      "steps": [
        "分母 $(x - 1)(x - 2)$，候選 $x = 1$、$x = 2$。分子 $(x - 1)(x + 1)$。",
        "約掉 $x - 1$：$r(x) = \\frac{x + 1}{x - 2}$（$x \\ne 1$）。",
        "$x = 1$：約分後的式子在 1 是 $\\frac{2}{-1} = -2$，有限，所以 $\\lim_{x\\to1} r(x) = -2$，是洞。",
        "$x = 2$：分子 3、分母 0，$\\frac{k}{0}$ 型，是垂直漸近線。"
      ],
      "answer": "只有 $x = 2$（$x = 1$ 是洞）",
      "claim": "(x^2-1)/(x^2-3x+2) == (x+1)/(x-2) ;; LIM((x^2-1)/(x^2-3x+2), 1) == -2 ;; LIM((x-2)/(x+1), 2) == 0"
    }
